('127.313.d.5.B',3,'Observation helps a teacher plan by showing:','["what the child ate", "what a child is ready to learn next", "what the family earns", "what the child wears"]'::jsonb,1,'Observation guides instruction.','original'),
('127.313.d.5.B',4,'After noticing that several children love dinosaurs, a teacher plans a dinosaur unit. This is:','["punishing students", "copying another class", "using observations to plan curriculum", "ignoring interests"]'::jsonb,2,'Curriculum follows children''s interests.','original'),
('127.313.d.5.C',3,'An objective observation records:','["rumors from others", "the teacher''s opinions", "guesses about feelings", "only what a teacher sees and hears"]'::jsonb,3,'Objective notes are facts.','original')
