('127.314.d.3.D',3,'When choosing educational software, a teacher should check that it:','["matches learning objectives and is age-appropriate", "is the flashiest", "has the most ads", "is the newest only"]'::jsonb,0,'Software should fit the learning goal.','original'),
('127.314.d.3.D',4,'A spreadsheet program is best for:','["writing music only", "organizing data and calculating results", "editing video", "drawing logos only"]'::jsonb,1,'Spreadsheets calculate and chart data.','original'),
('127.314.d.4.A',3,'FERPA protects:','["teacher salaries", "school bus routes", "the privacy of student education records", "cafeteria menus"]'::jsonb,2,'FERPA governs education records.','original'),
